{"label": "Anxiety", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Losing it at work All this week I’ve had pressure in my head and behind my eye and tinnitus and a sore neck. I’m so scared it’s a brain tumor and I can’t concentrate on anything. I’m so irritable and stressed out! I made a dr appt for later today but I’m worried they will be dismissive and not take me seriously. I hate this so much."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Tekanan fisik di kepala dan mata yang terus-menerus sepanjang minggu — badan kamu lagi screaming butuh istirahat. Stress yang kamu tanggung ini nyata. Kalau bisa, cari satu momen hari ini cuma buat duduk diam sebentar."}]}
{"label": "Suicidal", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "i cannot do life anymore, everyone i know is doing amazing and so well, my friends leave me out of everything fun, and treat me like a child. my gf is only happy if I am giving everything i can give. nothing can keep me happy. i do not enjoy what i used to love. I am to afraid to runaway. and i think suicide so so so much, and it seems to be an option that i should take. as i do not think many people i know would really care anyway i cannot"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Ngebandingin hidupmu sama orang lain yang kelihatan berhasil — itu trap yang bikin makin sakit. Kamu nggak tau perjuangan mereka. Please hubungi Into The Light Indonesia 119 ext 8, ada yang mau dengerin."}]}
