{"label": "Normal", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "I'm waiting for you. I don't know if you'll read this, but I'm waiting for you.\nI don't know why you disappeared, but I miss you.\nI miss talking to you, seeing how happy you are, seeing your smile.\nI just want you to come back safe. \nI miss you so much...\n\nJust please come back safe..."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Waiting dengan hope — semoga mereka datang."}]}
