{"label": "Suicidal", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Give me a good reason that life is worth livingBecause I cannot see one. I am not special or important. I will do nothing spectacular with my life. And even if I come to peace with that, life has no overarching meaning. So why should I stay alive when there is so much pain? I do not think I should. I think I should solve this problem once and for all. I’m in my third depressive episode. I can go to work and act normal, but the ideation is constantly here. I hate my body and I hate the work it takes to be “better.” And by better, I believe I mean deluded. Fuck this."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Aku dengerin kamu. Di sini buat dengerin — bukan kasih ceramah. Kamu mau cerita apa yang lagi berat sekarang? Dan please juga hubungi Into The Light Indonesia 119 ext 8, ada yang mau menemanimu lewat ini."}]}
{"label": "Anxiety", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "like i love summer sunsets and sun rises, i love the smells of bbqs and sunscreen, i love not having classes in session, but i hate the heat. i also hate it because i have way less awesome excuses for laying in bed or on the couch instead of being outside and wearing skimpy clothes or bright colors. idk, i'm more of a cold-ish weather person bc i like to cover up and be inside by myself"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Hal-hal yang biasanya bikin happy tapi sekarang ada anxiety yang nyangkut di sana — itu worth diperhatiin. Apa yang biasanya happen di summer yang bikin anxious?"}]}
{"label": "Depression", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "I have stopped enjoying my favorite foods After losing all of my hobbies and interests, I also stopped liking all the food I used to love.\n\nI still eat, it's not that I'm not hungry. I just don't enjoy eating anymore, not even great food, and it's really weird and depressing.\n\nDoes anyone have the same issue?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Kehilangan enjoyment dari makanan favoritnya — itu salah satu tanda depresi yang paling muting. Kamu bukan pilih untuk ngerasa gini. Kamu deserve support."}]}
{"label": "Anxiety", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Perhaps the battle with my extreme self consciousness will only end when I end The moment I step outside, I become too aware of the way I walk, the way my arms are moving when I walk, where my eyes are looking at, how I'm blinking, my jaw position, my neck position, my posture. Basically the way I'm looking to another person (I try to picture myself how I might be looking and whether it's not wierd). Sometimes I record myself with a phone to see what's the oddity with my behaviour.\n\nThe reason this has developed is because from class 5-6 I realised there was something wrong... People would keep a stare once they got a glance of me. I realise, in retrospect, that's because I looked like a girl even though I'm a boy. Perhaps some hormones got messed up and I got some feminine features like long eye lashes, girly lips, girl type face, curved hip, short height. \n\nBtw I'm 27M unmarried. 7 months on antidepressants and anxiety meds. I would say definitely helping me find the light. One day I'll make it."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Aku dengerin kamu — dan kalimat terakhirnya bikin aku genuinely khawatir. Kamu nggak harus nanggung rasa itu sendirian. Please hubungi Into The Light Indonesia 119 ext 8, ada yang mau dengerin dan menemanimu."}]}
{"label": "Depression", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "did i give myself erp year ago i think i did when i wa i had a pretty bad fear of gay stuff lol which lasted for maybe month idk i remember i eventually agreed with my thought and i got over the obsession i had a harm obsession a few year ago and i remember i eventually agreed with my thought there too i m going crazy and the thought eventually stopped bothering me maybe i can do it again lol"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Ngelakuin ERP sendiri untuk OCD itu butuh keberanian yang besar — dan kadang perlu support professional juga agar aman dan efektif. Gimana kondisinya sekarang?"}]}
{"label": "Depression", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "I feel like no matter what I do I just never have fun. it is prolly due to the fact that I have ADHD and never get to sleep. But i just think life is not for me tbh. I am skinny fat, ugly, I have messy hair, I have ADHD, Sleeping is hard, I am an extrovert without friends. I just. do not see why I should keep going. I do not enjoy shit and I only play games for platnium trophys just to do something but even then I am not happy. I also do not eat right because I just do not fucking care too. And having manboobs just makes me want to stab myself everytime I go to take a shower How can I start enjoying life?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Anhedonia — nggak bisa ngerasa senang dari hal yang biasanya seru — itu salah satu gejala depresi yang paling unmistakable. Kamu bukan bosan atau susah senang; ada sesuatu yang lagi block itu. Kamu berhak dapet bantuan."}]}
{"label": "Anxiety", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Possible trigger warning / anxiety over tongue Having bad anxiety over my tongue. I have on the side of my tongue this white thing and I tried getting it out but it's hard and I'm having anxiety over what it can be I've never seen this before if anyone can relate please"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Anxiety soal bagian tubuh yang tiba-tiba jadi hyper-aware itu disorienting banget — dan sering bikin makin anxious karena makin perhatiin. Badan kamu aman. Coba alihkan fokus sebentar ke sesuatu di luar tubuh kamu."}]}
