{"label": "Suicidal", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "The gun is loaded, it would be so easy. So quick. The pain would be gone and I could just sleep forever. I am so scared. Now I am just sitting here mad at myself because I did not do it. do not get it"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Aku dengerin kamu, dan aku genuinely khawatir dengan keselamatanmu sekarang. Please hubungi Into The Light Indonesia 119 ext 8 segera — atau pergi ke IGD terdekat. Kamu nggak harus sendirian di momen ini."}]}
{"label": "Anxiety", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "me too. i pretty much use the “discard” function instead of the “send.” i can’t even count how many hours i’ve spent writing small essays on reddit just to discard them as soon as i’m done. part of me wants to vent, part of me wants to give advice, part of me wants to tell that joke. i always write meaning to have my voice heard, but at the last second i reject myself. “no one wants to read this.” is it an extension of how i communicate all the time? definitely. did i delete half of this before posting? um, probably more. taking the plunge to send this time! anybody have thoughts? feel the same? take the plunge with me, lurkers!"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Discard button yang menyelamatkan banyak banget ya — dan itu bentuk self-awareness yang bagus. Kamu tau apa yang perlu dan nggak perlu dikirim."}]}
{"label": "Suicidal", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Fuck man, i want to die, I am in so much legal shit, anytime i try to talk to my parents about how i feel i get bitched at, writing a note. i wish i had a gun I am afraid this knife is going to be slow an painful. suicide"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Lagi kena masalah hukum dan nggak ada yang mau dengerin — itu sangat overwhelming dan lonely. Please hubungi Into The Light Indonesia 119 ext 8 — ada yang genuinely mau dengerin dan menemanimu."}]}
{"label": "Depression", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "I am still young, too young matter fact. Yet I feel completely numb, I feel like things around me happen just for the sake of killing time till I get old. I feel like life consistently finds a way to keep me just alive enough to function in society, while making sure I do not thrive and find personal satisfaction somehow. I am beyond exhausted. But I cannot find a way to break this cycle. Every achievement has brought me some sort of massive setback"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Numb di usia yang 'seharusnya' lagi semangat-semangatnya — itu confusing banget dan bikin isolation makin dalam. Perasaan itu valid, dan kamu deserve support sekarang, bukan nunggu lebih parah."}]}
{"label": "Suicidal", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "I do not believe I will ever do it but I wrote a note for some reason and it terrifies me. Just a few hours ago I was having a panic attack when I grabbed a rope and tied it around my neck till I could not breathe. I wrote a suicide note yeaterday"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Nulis note itu dan takut sendiri sama apa yang kamu tulis — itu penting untuk diterusin ke seseorang sekarang. Please hubungi Into The Light Indonesia 119 ext 8. Kamu deserve dukungan yang proper."}]}
{"label": "Anxiety", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Sensation of throat closing So yeah been rough with HA, most notably an anaphylaxis fear. Every so often my throat just feels tight, or odd sensations in my throat make it feel hard to breathe, it feels like it’s closing which sends me into a panic. I want to know if this sensation is normal for HA. I can barely eat or be close to anything with nuts or seafood without freaking. \n\nSometimes the feeling happens at random, without any cause, sometimes when I’m eating. Any advice on how to get over this? 😓"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sensasi tenggorokan menutup itu salah satu yang paling bikin panik — karena rasanya urgent dan mengancam. Anxiety bisa bikin persis seperti itu secara fisik. Tarik napas pelan-pelan, kalau persistently buruk segera cek ke dokter."}]}
{"label": "Anxiety", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "my tongue has been completely numb and tingling and burning for 6 months. i’ve always had bad anxiety so i just brushed it off as an anxiety symptom. after seeing many doctors i finally figured out today that it isn’t an anxiety symptom and it’s actually an abnormality in my brain causing nerve damage to my tongue requiring the repositioning of a vessel in my brain. so now instead of graduating high school with all of my friends i will have to shave my head and have actual brain surgery, pretty terrifying. looks like all that worrying was actually warranted, always get your symptoms checked! sending love to all my worriers💞 just remember it can always be worse."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "6 bulan numb dan burning di lidah itu genuinely perlu di-evaluate dokter jika belum — bisa banyak penyebab termasuk nerve issues atau anxiety manifestation. Kepastian jauh lebih baik dari 6 bulan lebih khawatir."}]}
{"label": "Suicidal", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "I just want the hurt to fucking endwhy doesn't it stop shy doesn't it stop I just can't do this anymore. I was born broken. I've been broken since the very beginning. I'm in pieces. I'm a faulty human and I don't work. I can't talk to any body without coming off as inept and awkward. I hate everybody I meet. I'm a phobe of everything - I'm scared of immigrants, I'm scared of queers. everything frightens and disgusts me. I'm so tired of hating everything and I'm tired of hating myself. why won't it end"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Aku dengerin kamu — dan rasa sakit yang nggak mau berhenti itu genuinely overwhelming. Please hubungi Into The Light Indonesia 119 ext 8 sekarang. Ada yang mau menemanimu."}]}
