{"label": "Suicidal", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "I should just kill myself now. Thanks a lot to those who just abandoned me. I am going to kill myself right now. I am telling all those who abandoned me that I am going to kill myself because of them. I want to die because everyone just abandons me"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Ditinggalkan sama orang-orang yang harusnya ada — itu menyakitkan banget, dan rasa marah itu valid. Tapi please jangan lakuin keputusan di titik ini. Hubungi Into The Light Indonesia 119 ext 8 sekarang."}]}
